local silent=effects.Silenced==true or (muzzle and muzzle.Effects and muzzle.Effects.Silenced==true) or template:FindFirstChild("Silencer",true)~=nil
if mods.Muzzle==nil then
local baseline=state.Records[2].Original
silent=baseline==true or (baseline==nil and state.BuiltinSilenced)
end
state.Values={encoded,silent};state.Mods=mods;state.Catalog=catalog
A.SyncCapacity(state)
